<h1>Modify (Current CS)</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from the</span> <i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>tree context menu for Current CS &gt; Modify</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Command">Modify (Current CS)</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command translates and rotates the current CS. The actual behaviour is changing the transformation matrix of the current CS that immediately affects to all non-locked entities.</span></p>
<p><img src="Images/modify_CCS.gif" width="321px" height="204px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Translate CS</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Check this option to translate the current CS.</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>X</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– offset along Current CS X-axis. For example, if Current CS is translated with +10mm along X-axis, the X co-ordinates of all non-locked entities will be</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>decreased</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">by 10mm.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Y</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– offset along Current CS Y-axis.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Z</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– offset along Current CS Z-axis.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Rotate CS</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Check this option to rotate the current CS.</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>X</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– angle around Current CS X-axis. For example, if Current CS is rotated with +10 degrees around X-axis, all non-locked entities will be rotated by -10 degrees around X-axis.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Y</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– angle around Current CS Y-axis.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Z</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– angle around Current CS Z-axis.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Note" id="p1"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">: The translation and rotation are performed according to the axes of the Current CS, not to the World CS.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Related topic</b></span>: <a href="Modify.htm">Modify</a></p>
